NAME: an A-field postincrement on a number
DESCRIPTION: (} 2) reads through the A-field of the cell two ahead and then increments it; see behtests/afield_postincrement.beh
SRC:
(seq
  (MOV I (} 2) (Dir 5))
  (JMP 0)
  (DAT 1 7)
  (DAT 9 9))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  MOV.I  }2     , $5     
  JMP    #0     , #0     
  DAT    #1     , #7     
  DAT    #9     , #9     
  DAT    $0     , $0     